<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Control panel</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
    <h1 align="center"> Welcome to the control panel of your new smart home!</h1>
    <hr>
    </header>

    <nav>
    <p>
        You have four rooms you can check. 
        <br>
        They are:
        <ul> 
            <li>
                <a href="#bedroom">The bedroom</a>
            </li>
            <br>
            <li>
                <a href="#livingroom">The living room</a>
            </li>
            <br>
            <li>
                <a href="#kitchen">The kitchen</a>
            </li> 
            <br>
            <li>
                <a href="#garden">The garden</a>
            </li> 
        </ul>
        <br>
        It's also possible to navigate to the notifications section with the following link         
        <a href="#notifications">Notifications section</a>
    </p>
    </nav>

    <br>
    <hr>
    <br>

    <section id="bedroom">
        <h2>The Bedroom!</h2>
        <h3>Sensors inside the bedroom:</h3>
        <p>
            Required zones: Temperature zone (20&deg;C-24&deg;C), humidity (30%-50%), CO<sub>2</sub> range (&lt;1000ppm) 
        </p>
        <article>
            <h4>Temperature sensor:</h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <output>21</output>&deg;C <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="85">85%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Humidity sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <output>32%</output> <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="24">24%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>CO<sub>2</sub> sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <input type="range" min="400" max="2000" value="560" disabled> 560 ppm
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled> 
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="8">8%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
    <br>
    <section id="livingroom">
        <h2>The Living Room!</h2>
        <h3>Sensors inside the living room:</h3>
        <p>
            Required zones: Temperature zone (20&deg;C-24&deg;C), light zone (30%-50%), CO<sub>2</sub> range (&lt;1000ppm) 
        </p>
        <article>
            <h4>Temperature sensor:</h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <output>23</output>&deg;C <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="80">80%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Light sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: 
                <select disabled>
                    <option>Dark</option>
                    <option>Dim</option>
                    <option selected>Bright</option>
                </select>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="24">24%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Balcony door lock sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: 
                <input type="radio" id="liv-door-locked" name="liv-door" checked disabled> <label for="liv-door-locked">Locked</label>
                <input type="radio" id="liv-door-unlocked" name="liv-door" disabled> <label for="liv-door-unlocked">Unlocked</label>
                <br>
                Status: 
                <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="55">55%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
    <br>
    <section id="kitchen">
        <h2>The Kitchen!</h2>
        <h3>Sensors inside the kitchen:</h3>
        <p>
            Required zones: Smoke detector (Clear or Not Clear), fridge door (&lt;3mins), water pressure (1-3bar)
        </p>
        <article>
            <h4>Smoke detector:</h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <input type="text" value="Clear" readonly>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="65">65%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Fridge door sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <mark>Open for 2 min</mark>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="36">36%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Water pressure:</h4>
            <p>
                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Reading:</th>
                        <td>2.4 bar</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="71">71%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
    <br>
    <section id="garden">
        <h2>The Garden!</h2>
        <h3>Sensors inside the garden:</h3>
        <p>
            Required zones: Soil moisture (40-70%), UV index(&lt;8), last watering (within the last 24h) 
        </p>
        <article>
            <h4>Soil moisture:</h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <meter min="0" max="100" low="30" high="70" optimum="50" value="15">15%</meter> 15% <em>(out of range)</em>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="10">10%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>UV sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Reading: <data value="6">6</data> (UV index)
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="33">33%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h4>Water system sensor: </h4>
            <p>
                Last watered: <time datetime="2026-10-14">14 Oct 2026</time>
                <br>
                Status: <input type="checkbox" id="bed-temp-status" checked disabled> <label for="bed-temp-status">ON</label>
                <br>
                Battery: <meter min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="100" value="77">77%</meter>
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
    <hr>
    <br>
    <section id="notifications">
    <h2>Notifications</h2>
    <p>Click a notification to see the details.</p>
    <article>
        <details>
            <summary>Garden: soil moisture is <em>out of range</em></summary>
            <p>Soil moisture is 15%, but the allowed zone is 30-70%.</p>
        </details>
    </article>

    <article>
        <details>
            <summary>Bedroom: CO2 sensor battery is <em>low</em></summary>
            <p>Battery is at 8%. Replace it soon.</p>
        </details>
    </article>

    <article>
        <details>
            <summary>Garden: soil moisture sensor battery is <em>low</em></summary>
            <p>Battery is at 10%. Replace it soon.</p>
        </details>
    </article>
</section>

</body>
</html>
